(
    title: "Ghostbusters",
    description: Some("You bankroll a Ghostbusters franchise — kitting out a car with capture gear and driving to the hauntings that flash across a city map to trap ghosts and collect the fees. Every escaped spirit raises the city\'s PK energy and feeds a rampaging Stay Puft Marshmallow Man that must be headed off; when the meter finally maxes out, you make a last dash past him to bring down the Temple of Zuul."),
